      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "IPlaceholder text, this'll depend on the puzzle I think, because brother, I have no idea what any of the words on the outline mean, not gonna lie. I'm half convinced it was written in a weird wizard programmer hallucination or straight up AI. Why does he mention an H2 rune. What. There's no hydrogen here, what??\n\nI really think you should check through the writing very in depth, because I'm not sure most of it actually makes any sense. He mentions a data bus in a previous page, but this is a wizard book? Huh?\n\nAnyway, I'm just confused in general. Idk. I'll put his written comments in for Vane and Thorne, but the puzzle's up to you.\n "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0dbaabea45853494293403a1c4741dc3, type: 2}
